<view class="page">
  <view class="headline">对话档案 · 可行性验证</view>
  <view class="hint">在微信多选复制消息，回到这里长按输入框，直接粘贴。追加时也可再次粘贴整段记录。</view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="row"><view class="label">本机对话</view><button class="mini" bindtap="newConversation">＋ 新建对话</button></view>
    <scroll-view scroll-x="true" class="tabs"><view class="tab-list"><view wx:for="{{chatViews}}" wx:key="id" class="tab {{item.current ? 'active' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="selectConversation">{{item.title}} · {{item.count}} 条</view></view></scroll-view>
    <view class="row title-row"><input class="title-input" value="{{title}}" bindinput="onTitle" placeholder="为这段对话起名" /><button class="mini" bindtap="saveTitle">保存名称</button></view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="label">聊天记录文字 · 粘贴或识字后校对</view>
    <textarea class="editor" value="{{draft}}" bindinput="onInput" placeholder="长按粘贴微信多条消息，或从下方导入截图" maxlength="-1" cursor-spacing="24" />
    <view class="small">待添加 {{incomingCount}} 条消息 · 本机已保存 {{messageCount}} 条</view>
    <button class="primary" bindtap="appendDraft">保存新增记录</button>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="label">已保存的对话文字</view>
    <scroll-view scroll-y="true" class="history"><view wx:if="{{!messages.length}}" class="empty">还没有记录。先粘贴聊天文字，再点「保存新增记录」。</view><view wx:for="{{messages}}" wx:key="index" class="line"><text class="line-no">{{index + 1}}</text><view><view wx:if="{{item.speaker !== '未分配'}}" class="message-speaker">{{item.speaker}}<text wx:if="{{item.timestamp}}" class="message-time"> · {{item.timestamp}}</text></view><text selectable="true">{{item.text}}</text></view></view></scroll-view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="label">多张聊天截图识字验证</view>
    <view class="small">图片经你的 Worker 转交微信 OCR 识别；结果放入上方文字框供校对，图片不保存在本机对话中。</view>
    <view class="small">已连接现有 Worker。只有更换后端时才需要修改下方地址：</view>
    <input class="worker-input" value="{{workerUrl}}" bindinput="onWorkerUrl" placeholder="Worker HTTPS 地址" />
    <button class="secondary" loading="{{processing}}" disabled="{{processing}}" bindtap="chooseScreenshot">从相册选择最多 4 张截图</button>
    <view wx:if="{{ocrStatus}}" class="ocr-status">{{ocrStatus}}</view>
  </view>
  <view class="foot">v0.4.0 · 根据截图文字坐标区分左右消息。</view>
</view>
